# Purpose

This document defines the component engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish a scalable component ecosystem that promotes consistency, composability, maintainability, and long-term product evolution.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Component philosophy
* Component architecture
* Component responsibilities
* Component composition
* Reusability principles
* Shared component governance

It intentionally excludes implementation details, framework-specific APIs, styling conventions, and feature-specific business behavior, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to reusable user interface components, ensuring they remain understandable, composable, and sustainable as the platform evolves.

